### Task Management API - Test Collection
### Use with REST Client extension in VS Code
### Or copy the curl commands below

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### 1. Check API Root
GET {{baseUrl}}

### 2. Create Task #1
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Complete project documentation",
  "description": "Write comprehensive README and API docs",
  "dueDate": "2025-12-31T23:59:59Z"
}

### 3. Create Task #2 (without optional fields)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Review code architecture"
}

### 4. Create Task #3 (overdue task)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Fix critical bug",
  "description": "This task is already overdue",
  "dueDate": "2025-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### 5. List All Tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks

### 6. List Tasks by Status - PENDING
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?status=PENDING

### 7. List Tasks by Status - IN_PROGRESS
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?status=IN_PROGRESS

### 8. List Tasks by Status - DONE
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?status=DONE

### 9. Update Task Status to IN_PROGRESS (replace :id with actual task ID)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}

### 10. Update Task Status to DONE (replace :id with actual task ID)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/2/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "DONE"
}

### 11. List Overdue Tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/overdue

### 12. Delete Task (replace :id with actual task ID)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/1

### 13. Try to Get Deleted Task (should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks

### Error Cases

### 14. Create Task without title (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Missing title field"
}

### 15. Update with invalid status (should fail)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "INVALID_STATUS"
}

### 16. Update non-existent task (should return 404)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/99999/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "DONE"
}

### 17. Delete non-existent task (should return 404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/99999
